{
  "$introduce": "序章：爱丽丝用大锤唤醒土偶玩家，交代足浴店任务",
  "theme": "skyfootspa:alice_margatroid1",
  "isPause": false,
  "dialogues": {
    "start": [
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "喂喂喂"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.000",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "清醒了吗？"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.001",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "能听见我说话吗"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.002",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "呃……按照说明书，唤醒流程应该没错啊"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.003",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "……"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "brightness": 70,
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "……我来看看，“若出现故障请前往畜生界灵长园联系埴安神袿姬”"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.005",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这维修服务难道还要我自己把东西搬过去吗？"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.006",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "只能自己解决了。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.007",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不过我对这种构造不是很熟，直接拆开可能会坏。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.008",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那就试试土办法好了。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.009",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "魔理沙说，不管是什么设备，只要敲一下就会变好。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.010",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "BOUNCE"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "停停停停停停！"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.011",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "哎呀，原来没坏吗。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.012",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": ""
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "PAN_DOWN"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "呃，不好意思，刚刚头有点晕。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.014",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以能不能劳烦您先把大锤收起来。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.015",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "啊……不好意思，我刚刚还以为你需要维修，没吓着你吧。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.016",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "（我看上去像是没被吓到的样子吗？）"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.017",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以这位小姐，能不能问一下现在是什么情况？"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.018",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我现在似乎什么也不知道。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.019",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "没有写入初始状态设定吗……埴安神女士真是……"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.020",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那就先从我的自我介绍开始吧。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.021",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我的名字是爱丽丝·玛格特罗伊德，是居住在魔法森林的魔法使，严格来说是人偶师。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.022",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "而你呢，是一个土偶，简单的来说应该是类似于仿生人和机器人之类的……仿生人这种词你应该还听得懂吧，我不知道你的知识库储备怎么样。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.023",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "大致能听得懂。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.024",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "在地狱的畜生界有一位名叫埴安神袿姬的女士很擅长制作土偶，由于跟我用的人偶有些许共同之处……事实上我以前也想过要不要用土偶，所以她之前送了我一个作为礼物，也就是现在在我面前的你。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.025",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不过由于我用自制的人偶已经养成习惯了，所以收到后就一直堆在仓库里。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.026",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "简单的来说，我是你的主人，而你是我的下属。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.027",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "BOUNCE"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那你现在是有什么活要我干吗？"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.028",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "是的，我来到这个幻想乡已经有些年头了，这片与外界隔绝的桃花源，各方面都几乎如同它的名字般梦幻。但在这平和温馨的日常下，总是潜藏着浑浊的污秽。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.029",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "最令人痛心的是，很多人对此淡然地接受了，任由这种黑暗不断生根发芽。而如今对于这个幻想乡所积攒的陈腐习气我已经无法忍受了。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.030",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "于是，现在我准备对幻想乡进行一场彻底的创新性变革。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.031",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "而为此，我需要更多人手的协助。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.032",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你是我能想到的最佳人选，所以请务必借给我你的力量。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.033",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "难道你是想……"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.034",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以，我现在命令你为洗脚城大店长，统率全城。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.035",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "然后把这家足浴店打造成全幻想乡人尽皆知的超人气品牌！"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.036",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "幻想乡崭新的未来就靠你了！"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.037",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "BOUNCE"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "……"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我好像不是很懂你想表达什么。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.039",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不好意思，我的说明可能跳过了一些步骤。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.040",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "幻想乡在某种角度上是一个怀旧的产物。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.041",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这片土地被称为幻想乡，与外界不同，是充斥着幻想的世界。随着人类的发展，许多存在——比如妖怪逐渐式微，而这里就是接纳他们的地方。换句话说，幻想乡是为他们提供的，地球上的避风港。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.042",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "但关键在于，隔绝幻想乡与外界的“博丽大结界”是于明治年间升起的。在此之后，两边就无法随意往来。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.043",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "而幻想乡内是有人类存在的，他们也就在同一时间和外界断绝了联系。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.044",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以现在幻想乡内的人类聚落——人间之里还大体保留着明治时期乡间的风貌和生活习俗。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.045",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "也就是说，幻想乡人类的卫生状态以外界的现代标准来看有点不达标。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.046",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "于是，就需要我来掀起一场轰轰烈烈的讲卫生树新风行动！"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.047",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "BOUNCE"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那为什么是足浴店，正常情况下不是应该开澡堂或者卖卫浴用品又或当水管工加装自来水管道吗？"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.048",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "呃……因为这里其实还有另一个问题。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.049",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不知道怎么回事，也不知道是谁先开的头，有一股……令人尴尬的流言正在传播。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.050",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "什么流言？"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.051",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "……是说幻想乡里的人都不怎么洗脚，所以幻想乡里的美少女脚都很臭……"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.052",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "……"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以真的很臭吗？"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.054",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你觉得呢。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.055",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "……我觉得应该是香的，至少不是臭。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.056",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "原来前面的污秽指的是字面意义上的卫生问题吗。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.057",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "总之，要是给我捉到是谁在散布这种谣言，我绝对要把他钉在魔法森林的树上让他瘴气吸到饱。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.058",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不过现在既然抓不到人，就只能用其他方式来解决这个谣言了。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.059",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "靠开洗脚店？"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.060",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "没错，足浴店！"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.061",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "BOUNCE"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这可是我好不容易才想出来的完美方案，既能改善幻想乡里的卫生条件，又能展现我们非常在乎个人卫生。简直是一举两得。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.062",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "（这种做法……怎么感觉有种此地无银三百两的既视感）"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.063",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以就让我来经营这家足浴店吗？"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.064",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "没错，毕竟我自己的人偶都是需要我手动操纵的，而我现在又有其它事要做，所以还是作为土偶可以自主行动的你更加适合。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.065",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那行吧，毕竟在我的立场上也没有拒绝的能力。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.066",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你也别想的这么悲观了，如果你高标准地完成了工作的话，我肯定不会亏待你。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.067",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "毕竟我也不是什么恶魔，和我认识的那几个恶魔相比，我觉得我和她们间的差别还是不小的。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.068",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "真是无法被常识束缚的世界观……"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.069",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我们还是先进入正题，让我学习一下具体的经营操作吧。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.070",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "好的，不过在经营的时候要小心脚下。为了提升造型的吸引力，我向某个不良天人买了点小道具，所以这座足浴店是飘在天上的空岛。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.071",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我已经不知道该说什么了。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.072",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "接下来，我会帮你熟悉一遍必要的经营步骤。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.start.073",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "chapter1": [
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你比我想象的要熟练多了。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.000",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我原本还以为要多给你留几天时间培训。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.001",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "按照现在的表现你已经可以出师了。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.002",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我都有点好奇你是怎么学这么快的。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.003",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "其实我没觉得这个有多难。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.004",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "看来你的基础性能确实优异。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.005",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "之前在唤醒你的时候我大致检查了一下你的身体。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.006",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你的身体上似乎预留了一些接口。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.007",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "接口？是干什么用的？"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.008",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "看来这些信息没有提前输入给你。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.009",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "明明制作能力很强，为什么埴安神女士总是在这种小地方如此随性。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.010",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "简单的来说就是你的身上预留了饰品栏位。可以将一些特殊道具装载在身上以强化自身能力。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.011",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "刚刚你在熟悉操作时我回家里找了点匹配的东西，你可以先试试看。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.012",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这些孩子是很得力的帮手，要好好对待她们哦。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.013",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "解锁饰品系统，给予玩家部分初始饰品。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "接下来你可以开始正式经营了，我现在还走不开身，具体的经营方针就由你自己来决定吧，不要忘记我们的最终目标。"
        },
        "sound": "skyfootspa:voice.alice.chapter1.015",
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "chapter3": [
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你就是这家店的店长吧。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          }
        ],
        "command": "/chatbox theme skyfootspa:hakurei_reimu1"
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这位小姐，请问您是？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "明明在幻想乡内，却连这个都不知道吗。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_pout",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我是负责管理幻想乡的巫女博丽灵梦。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_open",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "开门见山的来说，我需要对你的店进行监管。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_serious",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "原来是城管吗，我不知道要营业执照。城管大人请你开开恩吧，我会交充足的手续费补办的！"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_serious",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那还不赶紧把钱……"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_open",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "停停停，差点就被你带跑了，这可不是营业执照这么简单的问题。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_pout",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "如果只是在人间之里内营业的话我是不会怎么管。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_think",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "但这家店的服务范围太广了，人类、妖精、妖怪……各种种族全都共处一室，万一出什么事极有可能危害到幻想乡的人妖关系。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_serious",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不过既然是在空岛上开店，说不定从最开始就是想达成这种状态。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_think",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "爱丽丝到底在想什么啊，采取这么激进的方式……"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_sigh",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "言归正传，为了保证幻想乡的安定，我必须通过我的亲身经历来确认你的店具有抵御风险稳定运营的能力。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_serious",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "虽然爱丽丝跟我说不要太刁难你，但这是巫女的职责，如果发现了什么问题，我不会因此就网开一面的。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_serious",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "准备充分后就用这个叫我来。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "reimu_open",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "hakurei_reimu_name"
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "来吧",
            "click": {
              "type": "command",
              "value": "give @s marguerite:boss_seal_reimu"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
